{
  "_notes": [
    "Embedded registry of pre-built Alibaba MNN runtime bundles. Real release URLs +",
    "SHA-256 fingerprints pulled from https://github.com/alibaba/MNN/releases/tag/3.5.0",
    "(2026-04-07). Bytes hashed locally with sha256sum.",
    "Last refreshed: 2026-06-06.",
    "",
    "IMPORTANT — bundle internal layout:",
    "  Alibaba ships ONE archive per (OS, arch), carrying MULTIPLE backend libraries.",
    "  The MNN binary is DEEPLY NESTED inside the archive:",
    "    Windows: lib/x64/Release/Dynamic/MD/MNN.dll  (MD CRT — matches .NET on Windows)",
    "             lib/x64/Release/Dynamic/MT/MNN.dll  (MT CRT — static CRT linkage)",
    "    macOS:   Dynamic/MNN.framework/Versions/A/MNN  (framework binary, no extension)",
    "    iOS:     Dynamic/MNN.framework/Versions/A/MNN",
    "    Linux:   lib/x64/libMNN.so  (or similar nested path)",
    "    Android: jni/{abi}/libMNN.so",
    "  NativeRuntimeFetcher recursively walks the extracted tree to find the binary",
    "  by name, with per-platform preferences (Windows: prefer Dynamic/MD over MT and",
    "  Static; macOS/iOS: prefer the framework binary; others: first hit wins).",
    "",
    "  \"mnnbridge\" is the CircleAI shim — NOT in Alibaba's bundle. mnnbridge ships",
    "  in CircleAI.Inference's NuGet runtimes/{RID}/native/ folder and is resolved",
    "  by CircleAI.Inference.NativeLibraryResolver via its assembly-relative fallback",
    "  paths. The registry exposes only MNN.",
    "",
    "Backends NOT in any Alibaba pre-build (need source build):",
    "  CUDA, Ascend, Cambricon, Linux arm64, Loong64, HarmonyOS.",
    "",
    "Refresh procedure (for new MNN releases):",
    "  1. gh release list --repo alibaba/MNN",
    "  2. gh release view <version> --repo alibaba/MNN --json assets",
    "  3. for each asset: curl -sL -o <asset> https://github.com/alibaba/MNN/releases/download/<version>/<asset>",
    "  4. sha256sum <asset>",
    "  5. Update version + url + sha256 here"
  ],
